        "descriptionHtml": "<div></div>\n<p>Take family bonding to new heights with this adorable \"Pilot &amp; Co-Pilot\" matching T-shirt set for fathers and their little ones. Perfect for aviation enthusiasts or anyone who loves a playful twist on daddy-and-me outfits, this set includes a \"Pilot\" T-shirt for Dad and a matching \"Co-Pilot\" T-shirt for the child. Made from ultra-soft, breathable cotton, these shirts offer all-day comfort for family adventures, photoshoots, or simply relaxing together. The airplane graphic adds a fun touch, making these T-shirts an ideal gift for Father’s Day, birthdays, or any occasion to celebrate dad and his little co-pilot.</p>\n<p><strong>Product Details:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Stylish matching T-shirt set for dads and kids featuring \"Pilot\" and \"Co-Pilot\" designs</li>\n<li>Fun airplane graphic for aviation-loving families</li>\n<li>Available in classic black with bold white text</li>\n<li>Crafted from soft, comfortable cotton – ideal for all-day wear</li>\n<li>Perfect gift for Father's Day, birthdays, or family outings</li>\n<li>Sizes available for adults and children, from infants to teens</li>\n<li>Machine-washable for easy care and long-lasting wear</li>\n</ul>\n<table id=\"size-chart\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Size</th>\n<th>Shoulder Width (cm / in)</th>\n<th>Bust (cm / in)</th>\n<th>Sleeve Length (cm / in)</th>\n<th>Length (cm / in)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<!-- Kid's Sizes -->\n<tr>\n<td>Child 1 year</td>\n<td>23 cm / 9.0 in</td>\n<td>50 cm / 19.5 in</td>\n<td>10 cm / 3.9 in</td>\n<td>38 cm / 14.8 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 2 years</td>\n<td>25 cm / 9.8 in</td>\n<td>58 cm / 22.6 in</td>\n<td>10.5 cm / 4.1 in</td>\n<td>39 cm / 15.2 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 3 years</td>\n<td>27.5 cm / 10.7 in</td>\n<td>66 cm / 25.7 in</td>\n<td>11 cm / 4.3 in</td>\n<td>40 cm / 15.6 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 4 years</td>\n<td>28.5 cm / 11.1 in</td>\n<td>72 cm / 28.1 in</td>\n<td>12 cm / 4.7 in</td>\n<td>43 cm / 16.8 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 5-6 years</td>\n<td>29.5 cm / 11.5 in</td>\n<td>76 cm / 29.6 in</td>\n<td>13 cm / 5.1 in</td>\n<td>46 cm / 17.9 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 7-8 years</td>\n<td>30.5 cm / 11.9 in</td>\n<td>80 cm / 31.2 in</td>\n<td>15 cm / 5.9 in</td>\n<td>49 cm / 19.1 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 9-10 years</td>\n<td>31.5 cm / 12.3 in</td>\n<td>84 cm / 32.8 in</td>\n<td>16 cm / 6.2 in</td>\n<td>53 cm / 20.7 in</td>\n</tr>\n<!-- Dad's Sizes -->\n<tr>\n<td>Father M</td>\n<td>42.5 cm / 16.6 in</td>\n<td>97 cm / 37.8 in</td>\n<td>21 cm / 8.2 in</td>\n<td>67 cm / 26.1 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Father L</td>\n<td>44 cm / 17.2 in</td>\n<td>103 cm / 40.2 in</td>\n<td>22 cm / 8.6 in</td>\n<td>70 cm / 27.3 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Father XL</td>\n<td>46 cm / 17.9 in</td>\n<td>111 cm / 43.3 in</td>\n<td>23 cm / 9.0 in</td>\n<td>73 cm / 28.5 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Father 2XL</td>\n<td>48 cm / 18.7 in</td>\n<td>119 cm / 46.4 in</td>\n<td>23 cm / 9.0 in</td>\n<td>75 cm / 29.3 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Father 3XL</td>\n<td>50 cm / 19.5 in</td>\n<td>127 cm / 49.5 in</td>\n<td>23 cm / 9.0 in</td>\n<td>75 cm / 29.3 in</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<div style=\"text-align: start;\"><img style=\"float: none;\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1557/1635/files/13706789339_1755694443_1024x1024.jpg?v=1589357538\"></div>\n<p> </p>",
