        "descriptionHtml": "<div>\n<p>Family swimsuit is made of high quality materials. Stretchy quick-drying fabric. It has excellent elasticity, fit skin-friendly, breathable, comfortable and soft, easy to clean and stain resistant.</p>\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong><em>Easy to wear &amp; move: </em></strong>Our Swimsuit offers fantastic freedom to your body with flexible making and comes with prime ease of wearing and moving. With our optimal quality Swimsuit, you never feel congested even for a moment as it keeps you comfortable throughout.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong><em>Hassle-free swimming: </em></strong>Regardless of the fact you want to have fun at a beach or need to swim at your favorite resort, our Swimsuit is up to the task for all the purposes and ensures that you can get the most out of your swimming activity.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong><em>Ideal manufacturing:</em></strong>Entire of making, stitching and manufacturing process of our Swimsuit has been carried with the natural and organic materials to ensure that the performance aspect remains on point in an impeccable fashion.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong><em>Convenient straps: </em></strong>Unlike many conventional suits, our Swimsuit has very flexible and comfortable straps which means you can take it on or off quite effortlessly without having to struggle.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong><em>Versatile: </em></strong>Whether is it a holiday season, party or any other casual function, the Swimsuit accommodates entire of your endeavors quite elegantly and never fails to impress the onlookers.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong><em>Bold colors &amp; textures: </em></strong>Being available in various colors and textures, our Swimsuit offers a great variety of colors for the users to choose as per the nature of their needs.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong><em>Easy to wash: </em></strong>Not only our Swimsuit can be washed by machine but it even it works equally well in case if you need to clean it by handwash and its enchanting colors remain intact forever.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong><em>Varied sizes: </em></strong>For meeting the needs of different bodies and sizes, our Swimsuit is available in multiple sizes and is up to the mark for all the ladies out there.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong><em>Cost-efficient: </em></strong>With the help of its ease of wearing &amp; amazing performance, the Swimsuit offers a tremendous value for money and that’s too without becoming a financial burden at all.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<ul>\n<li>82% Nylon, 18% Spandex</li>\n<li>Air Dry or Tumble Dry Low</li>\n<li>Machine Wash Cold. </li>\n</ul>\n<table id=\"size-chart\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Size</th>\n<th>Height (cm / in)</th>\n<th>Weight (kg / lbs)</th>\n<th>Bust (cm / in)</th>\n<th>Waist (cm / in)</th>\n<th>Hips (cm / in)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<!-- Children's Sizes -->\n<tr>\n<td>Child 2-3 years</td>\n<td>80-100 cm / 31.5-39.4 in</td>\n<td>10-15 kg / 22-33 lbs</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 4-5 years</td>\n<td>102-110 cm / 40.2-43.3 in</td>\n<td>15.5-17.5 kg / 34-38.6 lbs</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 5-6 years</td>\n<td>110-120 cm / 43.3-47.2 in</td>\n<td>17.5-20 kg / 38.6-44 lbs</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 6-8 years</td>\n<td>120-130 cm / 47.2-51.2 in</td>\n<td>19-22.5 kg / 41.9-49.6 lbs</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 8-10 years</td>\n<td>131-145 cm / 51.6-57.1 in</td>\n<td>22.5-31 kg / 49.6-68.3 lbs</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 10-12 years</td>\n<td>145-153 cm / 57.1-60.2 in</td>\n<td>31-37.5 kg / 68.3-82.7 lbs</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<!-- Women's Sizes -->\n<tr>\n<td>Mother S</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>86.36-88.9 cm / 34-35 in</td>\n<td>66-68.58 cm / 26-27 in</td>\n<td>92.71-95.25 cm / 36.5-37.5 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother M</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>91.44-93.98 cm / 36-37 in</td>\n<td>71.12-73.66 cm / 28-29 in</td>\n<td>97.79-100.33 cm / 38.5-39.5 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother L</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>97.79-101.6 cm / 38.5-40 in</td>\n<td>77.47-81.28 cm / 30.5-32 in</td>\n<td>104.14-107.95 cm / 41-42.5 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother XL</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>105.41-109.22 cm / 41.5-43 in</td>\n<td>85.09-88.9 cm / 33.5-35 in</td>\n<td>111.76-115.57 cm / 44-45.5 in</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
